From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StachowiakDawid <dawidos234@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:38:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: softisp: take the sensor information of the configured
 mode

The IPA module got the IPACameraSensorInfo once, at init(), for the
sensor mode that was active then (the full resolution one), and kept
using it for every configuration. A binned mode with another line length
had the wrong line duration: the S5K3J1 and the S5K3M3 double the line
length in their 2x2 binned modes, so the AGC worked with half the real
exposure time (ExposureTime and FrameDuration metadata 16.7 ms for a
33.4 ms exposure), and anything that needs real time, like an exposure
of whole mains flicker periods, was off by that factor. The output size
(frame length arithmetic) and the analogue crop (lens shading) were the
ones of the full mode as well.

Pass the sensor information of the mode being configured in
IPAConfigInfo and use it from configure() on.
---
 include/libcamera/ipa/softisp.mojom      | 1 +
 src/ipa/softisp/softisp.cpp              | 6 ++++++
 src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/libcamera/ipa/softisp.mojom b/include/libcamera/ipa/softisp.mojom
index 1656668..65c32b1 100644
--- a/include/libcamera/ipa/softisp.mojom
+++ b/include/libcamera/ipa/softisp.mojom
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ module ipa.softisp;
 import "include/libcamera/ipa/core.mojom";
 
 struct IPAConfigInfo {
+	libcamera.IPACameraSensorInfo sensorInfo;
 	libcamera.ControlInfoMap sensorControls;
 	libcamera.ControlInfoMap lensControls;
 };
diff --git a/src/ipa/softisp/softisp.cpp b/src/ipa/softisp/softisp.cpp
index 5741810..f5d2a0c 100644
--- a/src/ipa/softisp/softisp.cpp
+++ b/src/ipa/softisp/softisp.cpp
@@ -216,6 +216,12 @@ int IPASoftIsp::init(const IPASettings &settings,
 
 int IPASoftIsp::configure(const IPAConfigInfo &configInfo, ControlInfoMap *ipaControls)
 {
+	/*
+	 * init() got the sensor information of the mode that was active
+	 * then; the line length, the output size and the crop of the mode
+	 * that has been configured now may differ.
+	 */
+	context_.sensorInfo = configInfo.sensorInfo;
 	context_.sensorControls = configInfo.sensorControls;
 	context_.lensControls = configInfo.lensControls;
 
diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
index de43c97..cb59337 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -1693,6 +1693,8 @@ int SimplePipelineHandler::configure(Camera *camera, CameraConfiguration *c)
 		return data->converter_->configure(inputCfg, outputCfgs);
 	} else {
 		ipa::softisp::IPAConfigInfo configInfo;
+		/* The line length and the output size depend on the sensor mode. */
+		configInfo.sensorInfo = sensorInfo;
 		configInfo.sensorControls = data->sensor_->controls();
 		CameraLens *lens = data->sensor_->focusLens();
 		if (lens)
